he time, which is highly improbable with just High Card Queen against a range that includes many random pairs and value hands. It is better to fold and preserve chips rather than risking a significant portion of the stack on a low-probability hero call.\n\nReason: The pot odds are poor due to the large overbet relative to the pot size. My hand strength (Ace High) is insufficient to beat any value hand (any pair), and catching a bluff is not frequent enough to justify the cost.\n\nAnswer: -1"}
