e board texture does not present many draw possibilities (straights or flushes), making it safer to allow a free card.\n\nReason: Betting here generally only gets called by hands that beat me (better Queens) or perhaps an 8, while folding out hands I am already beating (bluffs/air). Checking allows me to control the size of the pot, keeping it small to mitigate the risk of my weak kicker, while still giving me the opportunity to call a bet if the opponent tries to bluff.\n\nAnswer: 0'}
